---
<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-24 md:py-32" aria-label="About me">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mb-12 flex items-center gap-4">
      <div
        class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-primary"
        style="box-shadow: var(--neu-raised-sm)"
      >
        <span class="text-sm font-bold">01</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">
        About
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div
      class="rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12"
      style="box-shadow: var(--neu-raised)"
    >
      <h3 class="mb-6 text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">
        Bridging technology &amp; <span class="text-primary">product strategy</span>.
      </h3>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        <p>
          With over a decade in software development and product management, I
          thrive at the intersection of technology, user experience, and business
          strategy. My career has taken me from data migrations and
          telecommunications engineering through a deliberate pivot into web
          development — and eventually into leading product and tech for a
          successful Norwegian e-learning company.
        </p>
        <p>
          I recently completed a Master's in Digital Product Management at Nuclio
          Digital School, deepening my understanding of how to shape products that
          create real value. But I've always been a product developer at heart —
          motivated by solving problems, not obsessed with coding literature and
          best practices for their own sake.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, as Head of Product and Tech at
          <a
            href="https://videocation.no"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-primary transition-colors hover:underline"
          >
            Videocation.no</a
          >, I lead the vision and execution of a platform that helps thousands of
          professionals learn and grow. I believe the best technology serves people
          — and the best teams are the ones that never stop learning how to serve
          them better.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
